     9FA4             (ine/constants.asm):00093         glb_d4_b equ   dp_extreg+13
     9FA5             (ine/constants.asm):00094         glb_d5   equ   dp_extreg+14
     9FA6             (ine/constants.asm):00095         glb_d5_b equ   dp_extreg+15
