                      (lision/macros.asm):00001         * Garde d'inclusion : un membre de pageset porte plusieurs units qui
                      (lision/macros.asm):00002         * incluent chacun cet en-tete. Un en-tete doit pouvoir etre inclus deux
                      (lision/macros.asm):00003         * fois — c'est vrai independamment du pageset.
                      (lision/macros.asm):00004          IFNDEF COLLISION_MACROS
     0001             (lision/macros.asm):00005         COLLISION_MACROS equ 1
                      (lision/macros.asm):00006         
                      (lision/macros.asm):00007         ; usage:
                      (lision/macros.asm):00008         ;
                      (lision/macros.asm):00009         ; in the main code :
                      (lision/macros.asm):00010         ; AABB_List_friend fdb   0,0
                      (lision/macros.asm):00011         ; AABB_List_ennemy fdb   0,0
                      (lision/macros.asm):00012         ; AABB_List_player fdb   0,0
                      (lision/macros.asm):00013         ; AABB_List_bonus  fdb   0,0
                      (lision/macros.asm):00014         ; 
                      (lision/macros.asm):00015         ; in the object code :
                      (lision/macros.asm):00016         ; AABB_0 equ ext_variables ; 9 bytes
                      (lision/macros.asm):00017         ;
                      (lision/macros.asm):00018         ; _Collision_AddAABB AABB_0,AABB_list_friend
                      (lision/macros.asm):00019         ; _Collision_RemoveAABB AABB_0,AABB_list_friend
                      (lision/macros.asm):00020         ; _Collision_CleanLinksAABB AABB_0
                      (lision/macros.asm):00021         ; _Collision_Do AABB_list_friend,AABB_list_ennemy
                      (lision/macros.asm):00022         ;
                      (lision/macros.asm):00023         ; WARNING !
                      (lision/macros.asm):00024         ; - When a box change from a list to another, you MUST use CleanLinksAABB after removing and before adding
                      (lision/macros.asm):00025         ; - Never use a single box in two or more lists
                      (lision/macros.asm):00026         ; --------------------------------------
                      (lision/macros.asm):00027         
0000                  (lision/macros.asm):00028         _Collision_AddAABB MACRO
                      (lision/macros.asm):00029                 pshs  u,x,y
                      (lision/macros.asm):00030                 leax  \1,u
                      (lision/macros.asm):00031                 ldy   #\2
                      (lision/macros.asm):00032                 jsr   Collision_AddAABB
                      (lision/macros.asm):00033                 puls  u,x,y
                      (lision/macros.asm):00034          ENDM
                      (lision/macros.asm):00035         
0000                  (lision/macros.asm):00036         _Collision_AddAABB_x MACRO
                      (lision/macros.asm):00037                 pshs  u,x,y
                      (lision/macros.asm):00038                 leax  \1,x
                      (lision/macros.asm):00039                 ldy   #\2
                      (lision/macros.asm):00040                 jsr   Collision_AddAABB
                      (lision/macros.asm):00041                 puls  u,x,y
                      (lision/macros.asm):00042          ENDM
                      (lision/macros.asm):00043         
                      (lision/macros.asm):00044         ; --------------------------------------
                      (lision/macros.asm):00045         
0000                  (lision/macros.asm):00046         _Collision_RemoveAABB MACRO
                      (lision/macros.asm):00047                 pshs  d,u,x,y
                      (lision/macros.asm):00048                 ldx   #\2
                      (lision/macros.asm):00049                 stx   Collision_Remove_1
                      (lision/macros.asm):00050                 stx   Collision_Remove_3
                      (lision/macros.asm):00051                 leax  2,x
                      (lision/macros.asm):00052                 stx   Collision_Remove_2
                      (lision/macros.asm):00053                 leax  \1,u
                      (lision/macros.asm):00054                 jsr   Collision_RemoveAABB
                      (lision/macros.asm):00055                 puls  d,u,x,y
                      (lision/macros.asm):00056          ENDM
                      (lision/macros.asm):00057         
                      (lision/macros.asm):00058         ; --------------------------------------
                      (lision/macros.asm):00059         
0000                  (lision/macros.asm):00060         _Collision_CleanLinksAABB MACRO
                      (lision/macros.asm):00061                 ldd   #0
                      (lision/macros.asm):00062                 std   \1+AABB.prev,u
                      (lision/macros.asm):00063                 std   \1+AABB.next,u
                      (lision/macros.asm):00064          ENDM
                      (lision/macros.asm):00065         
                      (lision/macros.asm):00066         ; --------------------------------------
                      (lision/macros.asm):00067         
0000                  (lision/macros.asm):00068         _Collision_Do MACRO
                      (lision/macros.asm):00069                 ldd   \1
                      (lision/macros.asm):00070                 std   Collision_Do_1
                      (lision/macros.asm):00071                 ldd   \2
                      (lision/macros.asm):00072                 std   Collision_Do_2
                      (lision/macros.asm):00073                 jsr   Collision_Do
                      (lision/macros.asm):00074          ENDM
                      (lision/macros.asm):00075         
                      (lision/macros.asm):00076          ENDC
                      (ast-zoid.unit.asm):00032                 INCLUDE "engine/collision/struct_AABB.equ"
                      (n/struct_AABB.equ):00001         * Garde d'inclusion : un membre de pageset porte plusieurs units qui
                      (n/struct_AABB.equ):00002         * incluent chacun cet en-tete. Un en-tete doit pouvoir etre inclus deux
                      (n/struct_AABB.equ):00003         * fois — c'est vrai independamment du pageset.
                      (n/struct_AABB.equ):00004          IFNDEF STRUCT_AABB_EQU
     0001             (n/struct_AABB.equ):00005         STRUCT_AABB_EQU equ 1
                      (n/struct_AABB.equ):00006         
                      (n/struct_AABB.equ):00007         
                      (n/struct_AABB.equ):00008          ifndef struct_AABB
     0001             (n/struct_AABB.equ):00009         struct_AABB equ 1
                      (n/struct_AABB.equ):00010         
                      (n/struct_AABB.equ):00011         AABB struct
0000s                 (n/struct_AABB.equ):00012         p       rmb   1
0001s                 (n/struct_AABB.equ):00013         rx      rmb   1
0002s                 (n/struct_AABB.equ):00014         ry      rmb   1
0003s                 (n/struct_AABB.equ):00015         cx      rmb   1
0004s                 (n/struct_AABB.equ):00016         cy      rmb   1
0005s                 (n/struct_AABB.equ):00017         prev    rmb   2
0007s                 (n/struct_AABB.equ):00018         next    rmb   2
0009s                 (n/struct_AABB.equ):00019          endstruct
                      (n/struct_AABB.equ):00020          endc
                      (n/struct_AABB.equ):00021         
                      (n/struct_AABB.equ):00022          ENDC
                      (ast-zoid.unit.asm):00033                 INCLUDE "src/stages/02/objid.const.asm"
                      (2/objid.const.asm):00001         * Object ids of stage 2 : the shared prefix, then the stage's own.
                      (2/objid.const.asm):00002         * Hand-maintained since the <objectindex> retirement (2026-08-11) — the dev
                      (2/objid.const.asm):00003         * owns the numbering, the builder places, links and bakes.
                      (2/objid.const.asm):00004         
                      (2/objid.const.asm):00005          IFNDEF OBJID_CONST_02
     0001             (2/objid.const.asm):00006         OBJID_CONST_02 equ 1
                      (2/objid.const.asm):00007         
                      (2/objid.const.asm):00008                 INCLUDE "src/common/objid-common.const.asm"
                      (-common.const.asm):00001         * Object ids shared by every stage — TIER 1 of the numbering model.
                      (-common.const.asm):00002         *
                      (-common.const.asm):00003         * The resident engine and the common units bake these numbers once, so every
                      (-common.const.asm):00004         * stage index MUST carry them at these exact slots ; a stage that has no
                      (-common.const.asm):00005         * provider for one of them plugs the slot (stage.placeholder). Stage-local
                      (-common.const.asm):00006         * ids start AFTER this prefix, in the stage's own objid.const.asm — they are
                      (-common.const.asm):00007         * free per stage, nothing outside the stage cites them.
                      (-common.const.asm):00008         *
                      (-common.const.asm):00009         * Hand-maintained since the <objectindex> retirement (2026-08-11) : the
