                      (-common.const.asm):00047         * The specific ids of every co-loadable set (stage/title objid.const.asm)
                      (-common.const.asm):00048         * start at 30 : the shared prefix must stay below that base. Growing past
                      (-common.const.asm):00049         * it would silently collide with every set's first specific id.
                      (-common.const.asm):00050          IFGE objid.common.count-30
                      (-common.const.asm):00051                 ERROR common object ids overflow the specific base (30)
                      (-common.const.asm):00052          ENDC
                      (-common.const.asm):00053         
                      (-common.const.asm):00054          ENDC
